Package: libhdb++mysql7
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: HDB++ archiving backend for MySQL and MariaDB
 The backend the HDB++ EventSubscriber loads (LibConfiguration
 libname=libhdb++mysql.so.7) to write archive events into a MySQL or
 MariaDB database. Built against the MariaDB client library.
 .
 The schema files shipped upstream are installed in
 /usr/share/libhdb++mysql7/sql.
